WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.459
(crowd talking in background)

00:00:03.459 --> 00:00:04.640
(thumping)

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:06.340
Think you're in the wrong line, compadre.

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:07.610
Uh, nope.

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:09.970
Doesn't seem like you're
dressed for Strong Force Squad.

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:12.230
Uh, actually, I am, bucko.

00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:14.510
There is no parrot in Strong Force Squad.

00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:15.360
Yeah, there is!

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.640
The parrot is always just off
screen so you can't see it.

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:19.020
What, how can you tell?
No, not...

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:20.050
There is no way!

00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:21.340
There is no way!

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:23.020
All the screaming and the explosions

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:24.430
that happen in that scene where Zapfon

00:00:24.430 --> 00:00:27.050
and Power Claw fight the
Insidious Sink in New York City,

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:28.010
that would scare a parrot.

00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:29.390
Well, I'm sure they got
a professional parrot

00:00:29.390 --> 00:00:31.243
who's been trained to be brave.

00:00:31.243 --> 00:00:32.076
(scoffing)
Oh!

00:00:32.076 --> 00:00:34.041
so the parrot wouldn't
squawk during takes.

00:00:34.041 --> 00:00:35.080
Oh!
No parrot is

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:36.810
that professional.
Or that brave!

00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:37.750
I don't know what to tell you!

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:39.650
Read the original comic books, okay?

00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:40.910
Zapfon and Dr. Struggle,

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.020
they have a whole conversation
at Strong Force HQ

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:44.955
about how there's always a
parrot just out of frame.

00:00:44.955 --> 00:00:45.788
There is no

00:00:45.788 --> 00:00:46.884
off-screen parrot!
Blasphemy, liar!

00:00:46.884 --> 00:00:48.294
(crowd yelling)

00:00:48.294 --> 00:00:49.327
Desmond Howe?

00:00:49.327 --> 00:00:52.720
Nice cosplay of the parrot
that's always just off screen.

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:54.753
Thank you, Desmond!

00:00:54.753 --> 00:00:55.586
This is impossible!

00:00:55.586 --> 00:00:56.419
He did not!
No way!

00:00:56.419 --> 00:00:57.252
This is a set-up!

00:00:57.252 --> 00:00:58.085
Desmond, I love you!

00:00:58.085 --> 00:00:59.180
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa,
whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa

00:00:59.180 --> 00:01:00.013
Hey!

00:01:00.013 --> 00:01:01.900
You two, you're coming in a little hot.

00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:03.228
Have a Snickers.

00:01:03.228 --> 00:01:04.500
(wrappers crinkling)

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:06.220
Guess it is possible
there could be a parrot

00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:07.500
that's slightly off screen.

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:08.410
Good cosplay, man.

00:01:08.410 --> 00:01:09.507
There you go.

00:01:09.507 --> 00:01:10.590
(chuckles)

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:12.080
Also, never disagree
with a celebrity again.

00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:13.980
It's very rude.

00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:15.855
Because we're famous.

00:01:15.855 --> 00:01:17.320
(crowd yelling)

00:01:17.320 --> 00:01:18.153
Thanks, Desmond!

00:01:18.153 --> 00:01:19.736
Thanks for the tip!

